{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"眼睛第一下落在左上方的大号引文，尤其是薄荷绿突出显示的“舒舒服服地待在这份亲近里”和“沉默也很舒服”；随后下方另一块同样醒目的大字容易争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他正处在两个人亲近相伴的氛围里，想舒服地待在这种亲近中；更具体的心理处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、安静、放松。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他其实很想表达自己有多喜欢，也想知道对方是否有同样的感受，却因为没想好怎么开口而让念头慢慢淡去；以及舒服之中内心逐渐漂远的转折。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块大字号、高亮度的文字争夺主视线，上方引文还没消化完，下方另一段大字又吸引注意力。\",\n    \"上方单块较长，处境、感官氛围和心理变化叠在一起，突出词只能先传达亲近和舒服，完整关系需要读句子。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上方引文和下方大字块里，要拼接才能理解他既享受亲近，又有想表达却没有说出口的犹豫。\",\n    \"中间辅助文字连续堆叠，需要在多行内容中筛选信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "15766956-b1ec-4867-8bac-2d9587bdecc2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T011522301878Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.109, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:16:01.409581+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5b4a1fae8996edd94bdf105b5458cf7c4179b25deead7e803bc5a0f12ad1c1ce", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_we